  "basis": "Exact-QID OSM way 557027632 / Q3133093 supplies the 110.801 m longitudinal plan and individual cutwater tips; the 14.569 m mapped width includes projecting piers, while the main deck is nominally 6.25 m. Standard PMTiles retains the bent pedestrian route and four artwork/cross points. Anchor [14.145583637,49.309829038], heading 0.095336761605: +X east/northeast toward the old town, -X west/southwest, +Z south/southeast along the Otava. Source datum 356.92734375 m follows native water 357.5273 m. Six width samples at the two actual mapped approach joins retain road and model support within 0.014064 m at every LOD. The western profile is raised for the coarse bank; these are visualization joins, not surveyed geographic accuracy.",
